<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES RESULT.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result on the final day of the four-day Supersport Series cricket match on Monday:</p>
<p>In Centurion: Northern Transvaal 334-7 declared and 155 (Andre Seymore 58, Piet Botha 5-35), Border 271-5 declared and 220-4 (Piet Botha 77, Brad White 63). Border won by six wickets.</p>
</text>
